@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-access-token-here
@createKey = person-create-example-1
@personId = paste-person-id-here
@phoneId = paste-phone-id-here

### Login (nao idempotente); copie accessToken para @token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Admin@123"}

### Primeira execucao: 201, Location e Idempotency-Replayed: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{createKey}}
traceparent: 00-11111111111111111111111111111111-2222222222222222-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Example Person","cpf":"52998224725","birthDate":"1990-01-01"}

### Replay: mesmo 201, corpo e Location; JSON reordenado tambem corresponde
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{createKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"birthDate":"1990-01-01","cpf":"52998224725","name":"Example Person"}

### Entrada diferente com a chave anterior: 409 IdempotencyKeyReuse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{createKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Different Person","cpf":"52998224725","birthDate":"1990-01-01"}

### Atualizar pessoa: 204; repita com a mesma chave
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: person-update-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Updated Person","birthDate":"1990-01-01"}

### Criar telefone: 201; repita com a mesma chave
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}/phones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: phone-create-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Mobile","number":"11999999999"}

### Atualizar telefone: 204
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}/phones/{{phoneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: phone-update-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Mobile","number":"11888888888"}

### Excluir telefone: replay continua 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}/phones/{{phoneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: phone-delete-example-1

### Excluir pessoa: replay continua 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: person-delete-example-1

### Restaurar pessoa: replay continua 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: person-restore-example-1

### Sem chave: contrato anterior permanece
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Probes nao precisam de autenticacao/chave
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
